{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FitKor 把重訓記錄與飲食追蹤整合在同一個介面，適合規律舉重者，也適合為學員編排課表的教練。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，程式沒有訂閱、沒有內購、沒有廣告，並提供 Apple Watch 伴隨功能，訓練期間不必取出手機。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-150.webp\">\n<h2>逐組記錄重訓與日常飲食</h2>\n<p>訓練支援逐組記錄與保留次數（RIR），智能漸進會讀取上一節數據並建議下一次負重，另可建立課表、排序動作及設定目標組數。飲食方面可掃描條碼、搜尋或儲存常用餐單並一鍵記錄，每日營養素對照計劃目標。體重趨勢圖會分開水分波動與真實變化，並估算每日能量消耗。教練可指派課表並在訓練時逐組同步觀看。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-267-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-268-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-269-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-270-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-271-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FitKor: Gym &amp; Macro Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.280717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:49:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:58:16.011150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:16.833217+00:00","content_hash":"9d4e22e1d5872bf450325733e6cabd3264c8d0c729001da64df15dbe3cf579fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}